  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-02-12T07:30:37.674Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The ability to have a prop with an animator that you can fully control on your avatar would open up a whole world of possibilities - no longer would you need to jankily throw together some toggle system for things like swords, guns, etc, instead you could just use an animation bool to enable or disable them.\n\nAll in all, this shouldn't be hard to implement as we've already got the ability to control animators in our worlds, and would be a huge quality of life improvement for a lot of people.",
